Protocol description:
    Start Bytes (0xAB, 0xCD)
    Destination Byte:
        0x01: toUSB
        0x02: toESP32
        0x03: toGR 
    Command Byte (1 byte):
        0x01: data
        0x02: diagnostic GR
        0x03: diagnostic ESP32
        0x04: Mandelbrot
    Data Length (2 bytes): Length of the data payload
    Data Payload (up to 1023 bytes): Actual data being transmitted
    Checksum (2 bytes): Checksum for error detection

Calculator check:
    Command Byte: 0x02
    Data Length: 1 byte
    Data Payload: 0xC7 -> check for GR
    
    response: 
        Command Byte: 0x02
        Data Length: 2 byte
        Data Payload: 0xC7C8 -> ACK all clear


ESP32 Diagnostic:
    UtilisationKey: 0xB7

Mandelbrot initialisation:
    ResultKey: 0xBA
    RunKey: 0xB9
    InitialisationKey: 0xB8
    
